WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Check your location. Inspect the current directory before changing files.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Create a practice area. Keep exercises in a disposable directory you own.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Copy and rename. Copy leaves the source intact. Move can rename the copied file.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Inspect permissions. Read the permission groups. Add only the access the task needs.
